Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:14.11,Default,Phoenix,0,0,0,,Someone... Anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.95,Default,Phoenix,0,0,0,,Protect Irene-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:26.71,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,You're going to do a very \Nimportant job for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:33.59,italics,Irene,0,0,0,,The High Priest of Yatan, Malaxus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:38.37,italics,Irene,0,0,0,,With the power of thousands, no, tens \Nof thousands of sacrifices and curses,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.39,italics,Irene,0,0,0,,he drove the king of Vangust mad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:45.13,italics,Irene,0,0,0,,and caused a plague in \Nthe lands of Count Raven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:46.78,italics,Irene,0,0,0,,He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:55.80,italics,Irene,0,0,0,,Doran, please give me strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:19.81,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(51,0)\bord3\blur2\an1\fs17\b1\fnGeorgia\c&H095DF8&\3c&HBFBEC1&\t(0,1469,\fs16)\move(365.999,253.999,359.333,248.667,0,1450)}O{\c&H0A27EB&}v{\c&H1828CE&}e{\c&H1026F3&\}r{\c&H1705C3&}g{\c&H1306A0&}e{\c&H0F028F&}a{\c&H090544&}r{\c&H211D2F&}e{\c&H000000&}d
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.81,0:01:22.91,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1080)\bord3\blur2\an1\fs16\b1\fnGeorgia\c&H095DF8&\3c&HBFBEC1&\t(0,273,\3c&HFEFEFE&)\t(0,273,\c&H252525&)\pos(359.333,248.667)}O{\c&H0A27EB&\t(0,273,\c&H666767&)}v{\c&H1828CE&\t(0,273,\c&H363636&)}e{\c&H1026F3&\t(0,273,\c&H7E7E7E&)}r{\c&H1705C3&\t(0,273,\c&H5E5E5E&)}g{\c&H1306A0&\t(0,273,\c&H252525&)}e{\c&H0F028F&\t(0,273,\c&H666767&)}a{\c&H090544&\t(0,273,\c&H363636&)}r{\c&H211D2F&\t(0,273,\c&H7E7E7E&)}e{\c&H000000&\t(0,273,\c&H5E5E5E&)}d
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:30.19,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I've finally got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.10,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Dainsleif!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:33.21,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fad(133,0)\c&H6756A9&\3c&H4A4663&\pos(320.667,230)}Dainsleif (Replica)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:36.51,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,If I enhance it, everyone \Nwill think I'm so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:41.34,Default,Khan,0,0,0,,I can't believe you found the picture of \NPagma's Sword Dance my ancestors left!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:45.32,Default,Khan,0,0,0,,You're the man I respect the most!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:50.23,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,You know, I'd like to get \Nthat armor, Valhalla, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:56.72,Default,Khan,0,0,0,,You're still tired from your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.95,Default,Khan,0,0,0,,Get some rest first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:01.90,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,He changed the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.49,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Is Grid-sama here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:09.66,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:13.33,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Administrator Valdi wishes to \Nspeak to you at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:15.51,Default,Man,0,0,0,,He says it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:26.51,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Wow! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:29.68,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,There's a forge in the castle, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.79,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,I won't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:35.15,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,I want you to make something for me, fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:43.16,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,As you know, the Blood Witch, Yura, \Nhas become the Eighth Servant of Yatan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:46.24,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,and with that, the church \Nhas become far stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:53.87,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,Kinbai Fortress, one of the strongest \Nin our territory, has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.65,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Yura, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:58.13,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:01.25,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,I'd like you to make this shield for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:04.82,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,to help stop their invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:14.29,italics,System,0,0,0,,You have learned the recipe \Nfor the Divine Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.31,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(129,0)\fs10\b0\pos(320,121.333)}Quest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.31,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fad(129,0)\pos(320,159.333)\3c&H7A7471&}A Deal with the Administrator 2 (AA)
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.31,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\bord0.75\fad(129,0)\b0\c&HD3D0CC&\pos(320,170)}Construct and turn in the "Divine Shield"\Nto stop the Yatan Church's invasion.\N\NClear Condition: Create and turn in a "Divine Shield"\Nof epic class or greater within two days.\NClear Reward: Depends on quality.\N\NFailure: Deal is canceled.\NConnected quests will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.31,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(129,0)\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H5&\c&H8B7261&\pos(320,170.667)}m 0 0 l 320 0 320 58 0 58
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:17.31,italics,System,0,0,0,,A new quest has been generated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.38,italicstop,System,0,0,0,,A Divine Shield contains
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:22.27,italicstop,System,0,0,0,,the protective blessing of \NRebecca, the goddess of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:23.47,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,A Divine Shield, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:25.27,italicstop,System,0,0,0,,It is powerful against \Ndarkness-type monsters, demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:26.53,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,This is my chance to make the money \NI couldn't make during my hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:27.77,italicstop,System,0,0,0,,and members of the Yatan Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:34.12,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,I've brought a priest here \Nto help bless the shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:39.13,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,I am a servant of Rebecca-sama, \Nthe goddess of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:42.09,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,My name is Cassus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:44.50,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Uh... hi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.81,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Mythril is tough to refine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:55.35,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,I won't be able to make more than two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:58.81,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,And if I get a rare, the deal is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:02.44,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,I can't mess this up,\Nfor my family's sake, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:11.91,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,Master, I've found out who the girl \Nwho took down Faker really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.58,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.41,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:18.38,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,She gave her name as "Erina" during the \NWinstone item crafting competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:20.29,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,but her real name is Euphemina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.84,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Euphemina?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:27.05,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,For the moment, it seems she has \Nno affiliation with our enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:29.05,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,the Giant Guild, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:33.06,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,We'll be in trouble if they \Nstart going after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:37.84,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,There are only a few blacksmiths in \Nthis game who can make good equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:43.22,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Every guild needs someone who can \Nmake something like those jaffa arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:47.60,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,We'll use Euphemina as a clue to find \Nthe blacksmith we're really after,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:48.75,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:49.66,Default,All,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:56.54,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I pulled it off in time, just barely...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:01.46,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,So? Were you able to imbue it \Nwith holy power or whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:02.68,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:08.72,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Rebecca-sama answered my prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.45,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Wait, seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:12.71,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Let's take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2.5\fad(133,0)\c&HD4C56B&\frx346\fry26\pos(222,116.666)\frz21.05\3c&H574A43&}Divine Shield
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\blur1\bord0.5\fad(133,0)\frx346\fry26\3c&H6E6764&\frz23.03\c&HD7D6CA&\pos(238,177.999)}Class: {\c&HCAA06D&}Rare
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\fad(133,0)\c&HE5E5E5&\3c&H6C6D64&\frz24.17\frx346\fry20\pos(206.667,214)}Durability
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\fad(133,0)\c&HE5E5E5&\3c&H6C6D64&\frz24.17\frx346\fry20\pos(219.334,238)}Defense
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\fad(133,0)\c&HE5E5E5&\3c&H6C6D64&\frz24.17\frx346\fry20\pos(208,274.667)}Magic Resistance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\frx6\fry10\alpha&H0&\c&H737764&\fad(133,0)\frz24.77\pos(201.334,211)}m 0 0 l 90 0 90 12 0 12
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\frx6\fry10\alpha&H0&\c&H737764&\fad(133,0)\frz24.77\pos(210.667,239)}m 0 0 l 90 0 90 12 0 12
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.60,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\frx6\fry10\alpha&H0&\c&H666B56&\fad(133,0)\frz24.77\pos(219.334,264)}m 0 0 l 112 0 112 12 0 13
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.29,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,This thing ain't blessed, \Nyou dickwad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.52,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Er, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:23.19,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,The one she blessed was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:25.40,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:27.07,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\bord0.5\fad(133,0)\c&H3994C2&\pos(212,140)\3c&H4D4540&\frx16\fry350\frz1.03}Perfect Divine Shield
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:31.15,italicstop,System,0,0,0,,Crafting a legendary item has \Nincreased all your stats by 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:33.95,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I did it! Legendary, hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.95,italicstop,System,0,0,0,,Your fame throughout the continent \Nhas increased by 1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:36.95,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,Did you finish the shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:39.79,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Pretty perfect, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:42.16,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Now, cough up the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:43.74,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,We'll pay later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:45.50,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,First, you need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:47.68,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,What?! That wasn't the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:51.48,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,Funds are tight since \Nthe start of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:52.92,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Then give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:55.01,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I'm not running a charity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:59.02,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,How arrogant. Throw him in the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:01.52,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Wha... This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:01.80,Default,Valdi,0,0,0,,Bring it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.23,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Hey! Give me my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.78,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Shield thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:05.76,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Rebecca, goddess of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:09.07,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Light of Purification!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.74,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,I suspected something was off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:22.32,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Only the clergy of Rebecca \Ncan use the shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:26.91,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,But they never asked for a \Npaladin who could equip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:28.73,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:32.68,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,If they made us make something they \Ncouldn't use, it could only be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:34.76,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,because they intended to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:36.67,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,They're followers of Yatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:46.65,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,You saw through my disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:49.28,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?! \NHand over my shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:54.07,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,If he can even hold the Divine Shield, \Nhe must be a powerful Yatan follower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:59.87,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,You are a mere priest of Rebecca. \NYou cannot stop me, for I am Musta—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:10.01,Default,Isabel,0,0,0,,My hunch was correct, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:16.18,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur3\fad(252,185)\c&H0FF2F1&\3c&H4FC1E2&\move(320,41.333,320,60,0,1920))}Isabel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:19.09,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Another NPC? What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.09,0:08:22.55,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Isabel-sama, you should really \Nleave the walls intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.55,0:08:24.60,Default,Isabel,0,0,0,,This makes for a much cooler entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:27.86,Default,Isabel,0,0,0,,And you, Yatan cultist...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:41.25,Default,Isabel,0,0,0,,First, tell me why you \Nwant the Divine Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:44.71,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,Th-That holy weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.82,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,Why is one of Rebecca's Daughters here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.38,Default,Isabel,0,0,0,,Now, start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:56.71,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Isabel-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:00.06,Default,Isabel,0,0,0,,He wants to play tag now, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:06.23,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Is this a quest where \NI get the shield back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.94,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,I should be seeing a window \Nany second now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:17.12,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,It's been thirty minutes \Nand there's still no window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:21.58,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Give me back my shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscy120\c&HD8D3D3&\frx6\fry10\frz5.579\pos(271.999,42.001)}Guild
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0.75\fs12\c&HD8D3D3&\frx6\fry10\frz8.375\pos(335.999,113.334)}Main Quests
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\frx6\fry10\frz8.375\alpha&H0&\c&HA48C7A&\pos(338.667,112)}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 6 0 6
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\bord0.75\fs12\c&HD8D3D3&\frx6\fry10\frz8.375\pos(339.332,148.667)}Quest
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0.75\fs12\c&HD8D3D3&\frx6\fry10\frz8.375\pos(343.332,166.667)}Find the Blacksmith
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\bord0.75\fs8\c&HD8D3D3&\frx6\fry10\pos(345.332,186.668)\frz8.991}Find and Recruit the Nameless Master
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\bord0.75\fs12\c&HD8D3D3&\frx6\fry10\frz8.375\pos(351.999,225.334)}Quest
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0.75\fs12\c&HD8D3D3&\frx6\fry10\frz10.61\pos(355.332,243.334)}Eliminate Euphemina
