Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\frx6\fry10\alpha&H0&\c&HA48C7A&\frz10.01\pos(354.667,238.666)}m 0 0 l 120 0 120 10 0 10
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\frx6\fry10\frz8.375\alpha&H0&\c&HA48C7A&\pos(343.334,162)}m 0 0 l 120 0 120 18 0 18
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.79,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\an8\bord0\p1\fscy220\frx6\fry10\frz8.375\alpha&H0&\c&HA48C7A&\pos(352.001,224)}m 0 0 l 32 0 32 6 0 6
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:27.30,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,I need to hurry and find that blacksmith,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.66,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,or I'll incur the master's wrath again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:34.56,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Oh, Grid-san, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:42.51,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,You're the annoying macho man \NI met in Bairan Village...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.15,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Regas, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:46.10,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,You remember me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:47.67,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:49.31,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,You look kinda down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:51.29,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Oh, right. He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.86,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,a do-gooder and a moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:01.36,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,The item I made was stolen \Nby the Yatan Church!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.20,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:03.62,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.47,0:10:06.49,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.02,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:11.07,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Don't give up on life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.85,0:10:12.26,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:19.89,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Owie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:24.06,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,You're helping other people instead \Nof doing your own damn work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.73,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,W-Wow, she's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:31.34,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Jishuka-san, \Nguildmaster of the Tzedakah Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:33.82,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but Regas is busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:36.17,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,He doesn't have time to help other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:37.98,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't get to decide that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:39.91,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,He said he'd help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:42.90,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,You're the one who just showed up \Nout of nowhere to beg for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:46.58,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Please! Give me the macho man! \NI'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.82,0:10:48.56,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,What's that? A lover's quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:49.83,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,In the middle of the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:52.15,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Oh, fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.79,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,I'll let Regas decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.20,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Will that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:59.35,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Helping the weak! Chivalry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:01.74,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Let's go, Grid-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:02.46,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Macho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:03.51,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Tch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:04.97,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:08.81,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,That martial arts otaku \Nis in for a lecture later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:10.44,Default,Woman A,0,0,0,,That wimpy-looking dude
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:13.04,Default,Woman A,0,0,0,,went up against Erina in the \Ncrafting competition, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:15.24,Default,Woman B,0,0,0,,Yeah. He was with Khan-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:20.57,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,We'll have the Divine Shield soon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:26.03,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,If we offer a sacrifice to endow \Nthe shield with dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:31.29,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,its holy power will \Nchange into great evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:46.79,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,And the curse will cover all of Eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.67,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,It's no good! We lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:59.07,Default,Isabel,0,0,0,,He should be close. \NWe must find him, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:11:59.86,Default,Cassus,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.15,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,Damn her sense of smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.37,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,Malaxus-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:14.71,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't bring you the shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:19.21,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,Rebecca's Daughters...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:22.79,Default,Musta,0,0,0,,I lay a curse on your clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.22,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Regas-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:33.05,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:36.37,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,What if this mountain isn't \Nthe right spot, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:39.23,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Then we'll head to the next mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:40.72,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:44.21,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,That sure is some cool armor, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:48.76,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're sure there's \Na Yatan hideout here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:50.20,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:53.66,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,One of my training buddies told me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:53.66,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fad(259,0)\pos(117.333,14.5)\c&HD5CBC1&\3c&H766C65&}Map
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:53.66,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fad(259,0)\c&HE2CCC1&\3c&H807369&\pos(201.333,22.5)}Luluf Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:56.73,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,that since the battles with the \Nallied army are heating up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:59.13,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,they've made bases everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:12.47,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,There aren't any cultists \Non watch. It's so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:15.14,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,This may not be just an ordinary hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.85,0:13:25.07,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Unwelcome guests, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:37.00,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(130,0)\move(309.333,85.333,330,85.333,0,2150))\c&HD7D6E4&\3c&H534F68&\frz1.409\frx20\fry20}Sixth Servant of Yatan Malaxus\Nhas appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:37.00,italics,System,0,0,0,,You have entered combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:41.99,italics,System,0,0,0,,The powerful Yatan magics of \NMalaxus, Sixth Servant of Yatan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:47.15,italics,System,0,0,0,,will apply status effects of terror, \Nweakening, and immobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:51.56,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Debuffs at the start of the battle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:56.52,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,I thought you were Musta, \Nbringing me the Divine Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.43,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Damn it! So stealing it was your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:00.98,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Give it back, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:03.33,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,You know of the shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:04.94,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Then you must die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:08.70,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Regas-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:18.54,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,He's too strong for a sparring partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.46,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:24.95,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,You can survive my magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.38,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Are you like Yura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:30.55,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Yura? I'm nothing like that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:33.11,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,You're a foe of Yatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:34.76,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Then I will show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.72,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Fast Reflexes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.05,0:14:40.69,italicstop,System,0,0,0,,The Blacksmith's Wrath activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.27,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I'm glad I buffed myself \Nbefore we came inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:45.28,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,+5 Dainsleif!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:48.15,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:50.30,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Pagma's Sword Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.76,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,An amusing skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.93,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,But if it doesn't hit me,\Nit means nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:17.55,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,What's with that cape?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:20.02,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I'll have to fire it off \Na bunch of times...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:23.58,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,No, I don't have the mana \Nto use it that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.98,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,I have to think about when I use it next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:27.19,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:30.15,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Weak... You're weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.15,0:15:32.86,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Fools, the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.01,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:48.67,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,If you don't want to get shot like \Nthat monster, stay out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:49.93,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:51.63,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:57.89,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Listen. Keep your eyes on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:15:59.43,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.52,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,a special jaffa arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.05,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I made that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:05.96,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,So it {\i1}was{\i0} you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.30,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:12.20,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,I have surpassed humanity! \NWhat can you possibly do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:15.52,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Surpassed? Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:16.89,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,You're just prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:20.88,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Prey for the Tzedakah Guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:26.60,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Me? Prey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:28.27,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:31.34,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,I shall sacrifice you to Yatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:32.67,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,Shield of Endurance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:37.22,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,You think those weak attacks will work? \NGive us all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:41.56,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,First, let me have the \Nhonor of fighting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.08,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Penetrating Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:51.62,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:57.03,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,He was able to react to that attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:59.59,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,Pon! You're trying to \Nsteal my glory again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:03.34,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,A DPS does the damage while \Nthe Guardian Knight tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.84,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,Did you lose your brain \Nalong with your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:06.98,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,What did you say to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:11.50,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,I'll show you how powerful a \Nfull-strength Guardian Knight is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:12.23,top,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:13.30,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:20.10,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,Mach Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.68,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate my triple shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.35,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,Tomahawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.69,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,It only took out one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:31.00,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,It's 'cause your weapon sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.99,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,We really do need a good blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:37.31,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,What? He can regenerate, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:38.99,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,All my hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:41.84,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Enough of your insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:44.70,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Maggots who would defy a god...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:48.42,italics,System,0,0,0,,The powerful Yatan magics of \NMalaxus, Sixth Servant of Yatan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:53.15,italics,System,0,0,0,,will once again apply status effects \Nof terror, weakening, and immobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:57.53,italics,System,0,0,0,,Malaxus's additional magic attack, \N"Anger of God," will activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:03.68,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,A powerful debuff skill, magic \Nattacks, {\i1}and{\i0} regeneration?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:08.96,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,And now the moment of truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:13.85,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Watch carefully! This is how you will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.03,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,Regas...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:18.74,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:22.04,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,High-ranking players lose \Na ton of EXP when they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.21,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Offer your screams up to Malaxus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:25.35,italics,Jishuka,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:28.25,italics,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Try to rescue him and \Nput everyone in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:31.42,italics,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Or give up on Regas and \Nconserve our strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:36.26,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Let go of the macho man, shithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.84,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Pagma's Sword Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:41.57,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Sei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:48.18,italics,System,0,0,0,,Malaxus has been immobilized \Nfor three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.69,0:18:49.58,top,Grid,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.69,0:18:49.58,italics,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:54.27,italics,Malaxus,0,0,0,,I thought my body only feared Yatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:53.85,top,Regas,0,0,0,,Thank you... Grid...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:58.86,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,You cannot overpower me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:03.16,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:08.48,Default,Laella,0,0,0,,This way! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:11.30,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,L-Laella!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:13.92,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,What's a world-class singer \Nin the real world doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.14,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,She's a member of our guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:17.62,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I'm your biggest fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:18.53,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:20.72,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:27.64,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,You had a rat here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:34.11,Default,Faker,0,0,0,,My cloaking skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:39.21,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but nice timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:48.54,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Maggots... I will send you to \Nhell as a glorious sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:51.81,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Noble master...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.31,0:19:55.00,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Unleash the hounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:58.68,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,so that they may\Nfeast upon their flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:25.57,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,M-My unbreakable shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:26.87,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Stand fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:30.04,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,If we can focus on defense and \Nbuy time for a counterattack...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.68,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,How brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:37.94,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,But did you think there \Nwas only one hound of hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.65,0:20:49.65,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Perish in anguish, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:21:00.78,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,How come I've gotta use \Nthe screwed-up one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:03.19,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Wh-Why do you have that shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:04.33,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:06.86,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I made it! So of course I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:09.49,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,You stole the good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:11.53,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.53,0:21:14.41,Default,Malaxus,0,0,0,,Where is Musta?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:18.96,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Y-You made not only the jaffa \Narrows, but that shield, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.33,0:21:21.72,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,What if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:26.59,italics,Jishuka,0,0,0,,He's not an ordinary blacksmith...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.03,0:21:29.30,italics,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Does he have a hidden job?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:32.34,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Grid-san, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:35.27,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Help the Tzedakah Guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.65,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Regas-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:40.34,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,I can't refuse if he's \Nasking me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:43.28,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,'Cause then I can make them \Npay me a shit ton of cash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.33,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:46.60,Default,Regas,0,0,0,,Grid-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.44,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,But in exchange, we split the loot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.44,0:21:52.79,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,If you agree to split the gold \Nand item drops, I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.07,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,He wants half of it for himself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:57.49,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,Even though we rescued him for free?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.49,0:21:59.67,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,You're all in the same guild, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:02.69,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,And it was Regas-san who helped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:04.76,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,You don't get to say shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.77,0:22:08.89,Default,Faker,0,0,0,,It's fine. Without that shield...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.89,0:22:10.73,Default,Laella,0,0,0,,We would've failed the raid anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.26,0:22:13.47,Default,Pon,0,0,0,,You agree, right, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.09,0:22:14.89,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.93,0:22:17.88,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Grid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:20.77,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Join our party!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:24.90,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,You're part of the Tzedakah Guild now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:28.72,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:34.21,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Actually, I should've asked for \Na 70-30 split on the items.

